for publish npm
- run 
node scripts/bundle-template.mjs
- navigate to 
packages/teapotapps
- run 
npm publish --access public

done :3

removed test or unlink or reinstall on local
- which teapotapps
if any teapotapss on local like 
/Users/your-username/.nvm/versions/node/v20.19.0/bin/teapotapps
then you can run "npm rm -g teapotapps"
make sure not exists teapotapps on /Users/your-username/.nvm/versions/node/v20.19.0/bin/teapotapps
and then if you want reinstall you can navigate you terminal on directory packages/create-teapotapps 
next step run these command node scripts/bundle-template-dev.mjs